{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18997","headline":"到郡未浃日登西楼见乐天题诗因即事因寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"到郡未浃日登西楼见乐天题诗因即事因寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖上收宿雨，城中无昼尘。\n楼依新柳贵，池带乱苔春。\n云水正一望，簿书来绕身。\n烟波洞庭路，愧彼扁舟人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}